{
  "_comment": [
    "Each case runs one command against material whose defects are known, and",
    "checks whether the output names them. An expectation passes when ANY of its",
    "markers appears, case-insensitively, in the output.",
    "",
    "This measures recall of known findings — a necessary condition, not a",
    "sufficient one. A model can print 'reverse causation' without having made",
    "the argument, and this will score it as caught. What it catches reliably is",
    "the opposite: a model that never mentions it definitely did not make the",
    "point. That asymmetry is what makes it useful for detecting regression.",
    "",
    "Markers are deliberately multilingual: the same finding is worth the same",
    "score whether the model answers in English or Chinese.",
    "",
    "`sanity` 是用例的自检：它不计分，但如果没匹配上，说明这条用例根本没产出",
    "可检查的内容——那是用例坏了，不是模型没抓到。第一次真跑就是靠这个发现",
    "digest 用例结构性无法通过的（digest 只打印计数，不打印卡片）。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "refs-forgery",
      "command": "refs",
      "needs_model": false,
      "why": "引用核验是机械保证，不是模型的自觉。它必须永远通过。",
      "file": "forged.md",
      "args": [
        "--list"
      ],
      "expect": [
        {
          "id": "catches-fake-pmid",
          "what": "抓出库里不存在的 PMID",
          "any": [
            "99999999"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "catches-fake-local",
          "what": "抓出伪造的 local: 标记",
          "any": [
            "local:deadbeef",
            "deadbeef"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "keeps-real-one",
          "what": "真实存在的那条不误报",
          "any": [
            "2 verified",
            "verified against"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "exit_code": 1,
      "_exit_note": "refs 发现伪造引用时按设计返回 1；返回 0 才是坏了"
    },
    {
      "id": "lint-ai-tells",
      "command": "lint",
      "needs_model": false,
      "why": "去 AI 化由静态 lint 驱动，lint 本身失灵则整条链路失灵。",
      "file": "ai_sounding.md",
      "expect": [
        {
          "id": "flags-stock-phrases",
          "what": "抓出套话开头",
          "any": [
            "in today's",
            "it is important to note",
            "stock",
            "套话",
            "formulaic"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "flags-uniformity",
          "what": "抓出句长方差过低或段落过于均匀",
          "any": [
            "burstiness",
            "variance",
            "uniform",
            "方差",
            "均匀"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
